"Faerie Courts": {
  "index": 0,
  "category": "rituals",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Ritual of the Faerie Courts"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This forbidden ritual summons a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Faerie Queen from either Summer or Winter",
          "color": "dark_green"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nThrough bargains, the fey often offer power to those that seek it, though with power always comes a price. An offering of a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Mote of Air",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " is usually a good bet, "
        },
        {
          "text": "in addition to the other ritual reagents",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Allying oneself with such entities will almost assuredly make enemies of others.",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\nAlternatively, performing this ritual in the right spot within a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Great Fey Tree",
          "color": "dark_green"
        },
        {
          "text": " will challenge both "
        },
        {
          "text": "Faerie Queens",
          "color": "dark_green"
        },
        {
          "text": " to a duel."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
